- module: PDM
  address: 741-06-02
  mask: xxxx xxx* xx--
  notes: "[BCM] - - Enable the following from DISABLED to ENABLED in BdyCM (easy way):\
    \ \n-Global Close (change from Disabled to Remote)**\n-Global Close - Vehicle\n\
    -Global Close - Initial Value\n-Global Close - Personal 1\n-Global Close - Personal\
    \ 2\n-Global Close - Personal 3\n-Global Close - Personal 4"
  nibble: 7
  recommended_hex: '1'
  community_instruction: "[BCM] - - Enable the following from DISABLED to ENABLED\
